"P1981448876" "Mr. Langley's receipt has been confirmed. We may also have additional employment for your operatives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3003250519" "We can't have an MHI at this time. Secure this location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3161867262" "Sister Helena"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1911761482" "Paradox Black Alpha"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2033125091" "Who would have thought a CIA operative would have gone down so easily?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4215929683" "Melvin Langley was no operative, just a file clerk. Hardly a challenge."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P522838515" "Ah, time for some real action!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Laptop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P826834291" "Langley's laptop"
// Description :
"P2260020383" "Find Melvin Langley"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3528387643" "You access the computer."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P977785347" "You finish accessing the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3920060954" "You found Melvin Langley's laptop."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P878186027" "Though you confronted his abductors and found some of his notes, you were unable to find Melvin Langley himself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2375966023" "They moved Melvin before you even got there. There was nothing you could do, {HeroName}, so you shouldn't blame yourself. <br><br>Melvin may still have a chance. It's likely that they don't really know what he knows, or how many people he's shared it with. They'll keep him alive while they try to 'clean up' the situation. That still gives us a chance to stop them before Melvin or other people get hurt. I'll try to find out who they're planning to target next.<br><br>And yes, by 'clean up', I do mean they're going to kill a lot of people. That's why we have to stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1496484784" "I don't have any new leads on where Melvin Langley could be, but I did find out that he interviewed a man named Jim Bartlett right before he was abducted. As I understand it, Jim Bartlett used to be a hero back during the 1940's, code-named Thunderhead. Mr. Bartlett's granddaughter filed a police report that her grandfather has gone missing. I don't think this is a coincidence. Particularly since I know where Mr. Bartlett is being held at the moment. Remember how I mentioned that our 'Friends' might try to clean up any loose ends? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Unless you can save Jim Bartlett, he may not have much longer to live in the hands of his captors.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1314738685" "Save Jim Bartlett"
// SendOffString :
"P1888651503" "Jim Bartlett's safety is your only objective. I'm sure you'll be able to save him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3372234755" "Jim 'Thunderhead' Bartlett was a famous hero from the 1940's. You have to wonder what Melvin Langley talked with him about, and why the Malta Group would be willing to kill him because of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P141665411" "I thought that old man was supposed to have been a big hero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2689073479" "Yeah. I bet at his age, 'Thunderhead' Bartlett can't even get his lightning up!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2328015207" "Here's a real challenge! We have an MHI!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3120341261" "There's been an MHI reported."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3898598416" "Hang tight, men."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1316193701" "Paradox Black Beta"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1769785193" "We'll dispose of the old man once we reach base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P963221347" "An MHI? We don't need this. Take out {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Thunderhead 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1410621848" "Jim 'Thunderhead' Bartlett"
// // Description :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1448516175" "Good to see you. It's gotten to be so a man can't retire in peace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1730900376" "Your quick actions were able to save the life of Jim 'Thunderhead' Bartlett."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P78535380" "I'm glad you were able to save Mr. Bartlett, {HeroName}. These people are ruthless, you have to understand that. Jim Bartlett was a hero and a good person, and they were more than willing to kill him because they thought he might have known something. Just the fact that he talked to Melvin Langley was enough to put his life in danger."
// RandomFameString :
"P2054277003" "I hear you saved the life of 'Thunderhead' Bartlett! Way to go, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2834603799" "Our 'Friends' are doing a little clean-up work at Melvin Langley's office, the kind of clean-up work that makes a lot of people very dead. They're going to go into that office, steal anything Melvin worked on, assassinate anyone who worked with Melvin directly, and then set fire to the place. Very thorough and very brutal. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to stop them from wiping out Melvin's office.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P501815775" "Stop the Malta Group from wiping out Melvin's office"
// SendOffString :
"P3910598695" "You have two main objectives to accomplish: protect Melvin's co-workers and stop the bombings. <br><br>I'm a little surprised that our 'Friends' would be willing to do something this overt. They would have to be pretty upset to do something like that, wouldn't they?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3652445643" "Stop bombing, save office workers"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P29826101" "You have two main objectives to accomplish: protect Melvin's co-workers and stop the bombings. <br><br>I'm a little surprised that our 'friends' would be willing to do something this overt. They may have some kind of cover story arranged for all of this."

