"P3689491671" "I heard them mention Melvin Langley! He has been hanging out with some strange people recently, but not this strange."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2716037130" "They were looking for anything to do with Melvin Langley, {Rescuer}, but he was just a normal guy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Boxes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2362201510" "Contents of Melvin's office"
