// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1276841247" "You saved the CIA office from an attack by agents of the mysterious Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1986690736" "Fast work, {HeroName}. That bombing would have cost the lives of a lot of innocents. Unfortunately, we're not a lot closer to finding Melvin Langley. We'd better stay on his trail."
// RandomFameString :
"P2325606421" "I heard you stopped a bombing in a CIA office. Who would be crazy enough to bomb the CIA?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4139963683" "I had something for you, but there's been a change to it. Crimson has the latest details, but I can tell you that it has something to do with the whole Langley situation. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you're interested, then you should go and speak with Crimson in person.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P766094039" "Speak with Crimson about the latest developments in the Melvin Langley case"
// SendOffString :
"P673785630" "Crimson's information could be urgent; you should talk to him as soon as possible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2317516772" "I'm really flattered, but you need to meet with Crimson for the next stage of this. He's handling this part of the operation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P992359092" "Thanks for coming, {HeroName}. By now you should know a lot about the basic situation. The people who had Melvin Langley kidnapped are still trying to figure out how much he knows. In order to pin that down, they've been going through and trying to hit anyone and everyone he might have talked about his work with. They also aren't being very subtle about it, indicating that they're either very worried or very angry. Either state doesn't bode well for Melvin's future. Right now, the Knives of Artemis are about to dispose of a woman who used to proofread Melvin's reports for him. I'm going to send you to rescue her, that's pretty normal. After that, though, I want you to go to her office and plant some false copies of Melvin's report. <br><br>The proofreader and the paperwork are the only really important elements in each operation, respectively. However, if you have to crack some heads on the way, I wouldn't be too upset. It's what we call 'verisimilitude'. Makes things look believable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1661549588" "Rescue the proofreader"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3978941978" "Crimson has this operation set up in two parts. You'll have to rescue that proofreader first before you can plant the paperwork."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P795944990" "Bullet holes in the walls testify that this old office has seen its share of battles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P359658337" "Sister Lethe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2280293561" "If it really is {HeroName}, then perhaps it will be a good fight after all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P335296806" "Let us see how good you truly are, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1012690483" "This woman deserves to die. A worm of words, she is no warrior."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4245425180" "Agreed, sister. She and all like her weaken us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1398282083" "Do you seek death here, {HeroName}? We shall provide it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1182565295" "Proofreader"
// Description :
"P3501145588" "Find the proofreader!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3215948014" "Thank you a thousand times, {Rescuer}! Oh, and {HeroName}, you'd better take this paper. They were going to 'dispose' of it along with me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P937106064" "You rescued Langley's proofreader from the Knives of Artemis. She gave you a portion of Melvin's last report that the Knives had also taken."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3132321601" "Take Melvin's paper to Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3202991805" "That would be Melvin Langley's report, right? You need to get it to Crimson so he can make sure it stays safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1150281939" "You, {HeroName}! You shall not shame the Knives of Artemis like this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3020695946" "Did you read this, {HeroName}? I didn't ask you to. If you did, you probably shouldn't have. There's names in here that could be a lot of trouble for a person to even know. <br>If you didn't, then you're not going to have a chance to. This piece of a report has places to go, and people who need to see it. <br><br>Now that the proofreader is safe and unharmed, the next step is to convince our mutual friends that they had no reason to go after her in the first place. So I'm going to give you an edited version of this paper, and have you place it in her office. Like I told you before, that's the only important part. If there are enemy operatives on site, they aren't your concern unless you decide to make them so. Are we clear? <br><br>If you have been curious, {HeroName}, you might be starting to learn a lot by now. If not, well, that works too. When Indigo tapped you as a resource, she told you that we might never be able to explain why we ask you to do some of these things. That doesn't necessarily mean that all the clues aren't there. It's just safer if you put them together yourself, or ignore them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound4_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4114267052" "Plant edited paper"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P503138485" "The neat thing is, whether or not our 'Friends' think the paper you plant is fake, they can't ignore it because it might not be fake. In a world with people like Nemesis and the Circle of Thorns around, paranoid paramilitary conspiracies can never be sure when they're being manipulated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3338999558" "You won't escape our wrath, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1302720079" "This small office is full of dictionaries, style guides, and thesauri."

