// Variable - NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// NEGOTIATOR_TWO_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4182394804" "These negotiations have been compromised! Kill {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1895360259" "Silhouette Azure Alpha"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ONE_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3376054483" "Crey Negotiator"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P671967422" "In the aftermath of the battle, you were able to confirm the identity of Malta's negotiator as Silhouette Azure Alpha."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1406963198" "That confirms it. If Silhouette Azure Alpha was there, then we know where he came from and where he was going. Combine that with what my own sources have, and we should have Melvin's exact location in no time. <br><br>Thank you, {HeroName}. I know that Crimson and I aren't exactly the easiest people to work with, but you've really pulled through. Not just for us, not just against those Malta Group scum, but for Melvin and everyone else. So, thanks. <br><br>It's almost time for the grand finale. I'll tell you when we're ready, and then you can do what you do best."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3432181284" "Well, we've found him. With all of your work and my own resources, Crimson was able to pin down where our 'Friends' in the Malta Group have been holding Melvin Langley. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>All that's left now is for you to go in there and get him out.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1568024018" "Rescue Melvin Langley from the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P1722595478" "Crimson wanted to brief you first, before he sent you in. He wouldn't tell me why; he told me I didn't need to know. Turn about is fair play, I guess. So the first thing to do is to go and see him. He'll give you the exact location, and you can proceed from there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound12_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P902456627" "Crimson waiting to meet with you in person. He wants to brief you about the situation before he'll send you in to rescue Melvin Langley."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2532286865" "Come, sisters! To the attack! Destroy {HeroName} completely!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P220319199" "All right, {HeroName}, I'm glad to see you came. Indigo's information has checked out, as does yours. Melvin Langley is still being held in the city, they were too worried about you catching them in mid-transfer to try and smuggle him out. they're holding him in an old Council base. I scoped the place out myself earlier, but the guard was too heavy for me to get our boy out. That's going to be your job. Melvin himself is in as good a shape as can be expected. He's resisted their torture, and is still in pretty good health. They haven't done any brainwashing or mind control on him yet, because they didn't want to hurt any information he may have had, so that's one less worry. All you'll have to do is focus on taking out the guards and getting our boy to safety. Oh, and I almost forgot. You're gonna have to take out the base's leader, too. A hardcase called Paradox Black Omega. But that shouldn't be tough for you. As Indigo would say: Easy! <br><br>After you've rescued Melvin, come back and talk with me again. There's an explanation I owe you about something. I don't give many explanations, so you better just think of this as a special occasion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Malta_Compound12_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3551820962" "Defeat Paradox Black & his men"
